{"v":1,"src":"scribe+alignement","coverage":0.968,"lines":[{"text":"Oh oh oh…","t":8.42,"e":9.22,"w":[["Oh",8.42,8.62],["oh",8.72,8.92],["oh",9.02,9.22]],"ok":0.0},{"text":"Aïe maman…","t":9.32,"e":10.32,"w":[["Aïe",9.32,9.5],["maman",9.58,10.32]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Les oreilles m’ont trompée…","t":12.16,"e":13.8,"w":[["Les",12.16,12.36],["oreilles",12.42,12.78],["m’ont",12.84,13],["trompée",13.06,13.8]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Aujourd’hui mon cœur pleure…","t":17.12,"e":19.54,"w":[["Aujourd’hui",17.12,17.96],["mon",18.08,18.24],["cœur",18.32,18.72],["pleure",18.88,19.54]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"J’avais trouvé l’homme que j’attendais,","t":29.1,"e":31.58,"w":[["J’avais",29.1,29.48],["trouvé",29.52,29.94],["l’homme",30,30.22],["que",30.3,30.42],["j’attendais",30.46,31.58]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Celui qui m’aimait sans jamais calculer.","t":33.88,"e":36.8,"w":[["Celui",33.88,34.28],["qui",34.34,34.48],["m’aimait",34.56,34.94],["sans",35.02,35.18],["jamais",35.26,35.68],["calculer",35.74,36.8]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Quand la vie devenait difficile,","t":39.42,"e":42.24,"w":[["Quand",39.42,39.58],["la",39.62,39.76],["vie",39.8,39.98],["devenait",40.06,40.7],["difficile",40.78,42.24]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"C’était son épaule qui me rendait tranquille.","t":43.48,"e":47.56,"w":[["C’était",43.48,43.88],["son",44.02,44.52],["épaule",44.62,45.12],["qui",45.18,45.34],["me",45.46,45.62],["rendait",45.7,46.52],["tranquille",46.62,47.56]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Il me couvrait d’amour et de respect,","t":49.4,"e":51.96,"w":[["Il",49.4,49.52],["me",49.58,49.72],["couvrait",49.78,50.18],["d’amour",50.22,50.7],["et",50.74,50.86],["de",50.92,51.1],["respect",51.2,51.96]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Chaque jour il cherchait à me valoriser.","t":53.86,"e":57.36,"w":[["Chaque",53.86,54.2],["jour",54.26,54.6],["il",54.68,54.8],["cherchait",54.86,55.58],["à",55.68,55.78],["me",55.88,56.04],["valoriser",56.14,57.36]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Quand je tombais il me relevait,","t":59.64,"e":62.24,"w":[["Quand",59.64,60.1],["je",60.18,60.34],["tombais",60.42,60.92],["il",61.02,61.08],["me",61.16,61.28],["relevait",61.38,62.24]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Mon bonheur était là, mais je ne le voyais pas.","t":63.4,"e":67.64,"w":[["Mon",63.4,63.54],["bonheur",63.58,63.98],["était",64.08,64.42],["là",64.56,64.76],["mais",65.54,65.74],["je",66.02,66.14],["ne",66.2,66.3],["le",66.36,66.48],["voyais",66.56,67.14],["pas",67.24,67.64]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Mais les copines parlaient…","t":69.92,"e":71.22,"w":[["Mais",69.92,70.04],["les",70.08,70.2],["copines",70.24,70.7],["parlaient",70.76,71.22]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Le quartier parlait…","t":71.58,"e":72.52,"w":[["Le",71.58,71.68],["quartier",71.74,72.04],["parlait",72.12,72.52]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Les jaloux parlaient…","t":72.88,"e":73.82,"w":[["Les",72.88,72.98],["jaloux",73.02,73.34],["parlaient",73.4,73.82]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Et moi je les écoutais…","t":73.88,"e":75.38,"w":[["Et",73.88,73.96],["moi",74.02,74.12],["je",74.2,74.3],["les",74.34,74.5],["écoutais",74.6,75.38]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Petit à petit…","t":75.5,"e":76.62,"w":[["Petit",75.5,75.82],["à",75.88,75.94],["petit",76.04,76.62]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Le doute est entré dans ma vie…","t":78.1,"e":80.38,"w":[["Le",78.1,78.2],["doute",78.28,78.48],["est",78.52,78.68],["entré",78.72,79.34],["dans",79.42,79.62],["ma",79.7,79.96],["vie",80.04,80.38]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Aïe maman, j’ai gâté mon bonheur…","t":80.96,"e":83.94,"w":[["Aïe",80.96,81.26],["maman",81.34,81.86],["j’ai",81.96,82.12],["gâté",82.2,82.72],["mon",82.84,83.06],["bonheur",83.14,83.94]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Les oreilles ont fermé mon cœur…","t":84.32,"e":86.46,"w":[["Les",84.32,84.58],["oreilles",84.62,85],["ont",85.04,85.16],["fermé",85.24,85.68],["mon",85.76,85.96],["cœur",86.08,86.46]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"J’ai laissé partir ma perle rare,","t":86.52,"e":89.06,"w":[["J’ai",86.52,86.68],["laissé",86.74,87.1],["partir",87.2,87.62],["ma",87.72,87.94],["perle",88.04,88.56],["rare",88.7,89.06]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Aujourd’hui je pleure dans le noir.","t":89.2,"e":91.76,"w":[["Aujourd’hui",89.2,89.8],["je",90.3,90.54],["pleure",90.62,90.86],["dans",90.9,91.06],["le",91.1,91.22],["noir",91.3,91.76]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Aïe maman, j’ai gâté mon destin…","t":91.93,"e":94.2,"w":[["Aïe",91.93,92.13],["maman",92.1,92.3],["j’ai",92.4,92.56],["gâté",92.62,93.16],["mon",93.26,93.48],["destin",93.54,94.2]],"ok":0.83},{"text":"J’ai cru les autres au lieu du mien…","t":94.66,"e":96.8,"w":[["J’ai",94.66,94.9],["cru",94.98,95.16],["les",95.22,95.42],["autres",95.46,95.72],["au",95.74,95.82],["lieu",95.9,96.1],["du",96.16,96.34],["mien",96.44,96.8]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Quand l’amour frappait à ma porte,","t":96.96,"e":99.5,"w":[["Quand",96.96,97.14],["l’amour",97.18,97.7],["frappait",97.82,98.36],["à",98.56,98.72],["ma",98.8,98.98],["porte",99.12,99.5]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"J’ai ouvert aux rumeurs les plus fortes.","t":99.56,"e":102.54,"w":[["J’ai",99.56,99.74],["ouvert",99.82,100.24],["aux",100.28,100.4],["rumeurs",100.48,101.2],["les",101.24,101.38],["plus",101.46,101.66],["fortes",101.74,102.54]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Eh femme !","t":111.7,"e":112.44,"w":[["Eh",111.7,112.04],["femme",112.18,112.44]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Quand Dieu t’envoie un homme bien,","t":113.28,"e":114.62,"w":[["Quand",113.28,113.42],["Dieu",113.46,113.58],["t’envoie",113.62,113.98],["un",114.02,114.14],["homme",114.16,114.38],["bien",114.44,114.62]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Ne demande pas au quartier son avis !","t":115.28,"e":117.68,"w":[["Ne",115.28,115.36],["demande",115.44,115.84],["pas",115.9,116.06],["au",116.1,116.18],["quartier",116.26,116.68],["son",116.78,117.02],["avis",117.12,117.68]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Les gens qui te conseillent aujourd’hui,","t":118.2,"e":119.94,"w":[["Les",118.2,118.3],["gens",118.32,118.48],["qui",118.52,118.6],["te",118.66,118.78],["conseillent",118.82,119.18],["aujourd’hui",119.22,119.94]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Ne porteront pas tes larmes demain !","t":120.82,"e":123.02,"w":[["Ne",120.82,120.9],["porteront",120.96,121.44],["pas",121.5,121.68],["tes",121.74,121.88],["larmes",121.96,122.24],["demain",122.3,123.02]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Les commérages sont gratuits…","t":123.4,"e":125.02,"w":[["Les",123.4,123.52],["commérages",123.56,124.18],["sont",124.26,124.5],["gratuits",124.54,125.02]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Mais leurs conséquences coûtent cher !","t":126.32,"e":128.44,"w":[["Mais",126.32,126.46],["leurs",126.5,126.68],["conséquences",126.74,127.64],["coûtent",127.68,128.06],["cher",128.18,128.44]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"On me disait :","t":132.92,"e":133.58,"w":[["On",132.92,133],["me",133.04,133.16],["disait",133.22,133.58]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"“Il n’est pas sincère…”","t":134.06,"e":134.92,"w":[["Il",134.06,134.14],["n’est",134.2,134.3],["pas",134.34,134.46],["sincère",134.5,134.92]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"“Il cache quelque chose…”","t":135.36,"e":136.24,"w":[["Il",135.36,135.42],["cache",135.46,135.62],["quelque",135.64,135.92],["chose",135.96,136.24]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"“Tu peux trouver mieux ailleurs…”","t":136.3,"e":137.54,"w":[["Tu",136.3,136.4],["peux",136.46,136.56],["trouver",136.6,136.88],["mieux",136.96,137.1],["ailleurs",137.14,137.54]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Alors j’ai commencé à changer,","t":137.84,"e":139.52,"w":[["Alors",137.84,138.04],["j’ai",138.06,138.2],["commencé",138.28,138.72],["à",138.78,138.86],["changer",138.92,139.52]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"À me méfier, à l’accuser.","t":140.42,"e":142.14,"w":[["À",140.42,140.48],["me",140.52,140.64],["méfier",140.7,141.14],["à",141.24,141.3],["l’accuser",141.34,142.14]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Chaque sourire devenait suspect,","t":142.94,"e":144.74,"w":[["Chaque",142.94,143.1],["sourire",143.16,143.46],["devenait",143.5,144.04],["suspect",144.14,144.74]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Chaque silence devenait un procès.","t":145.36,"e":147.34,"w":[["Chaque",145.36,145.54],["silence",145.6,145.9],["devenait",145.94,146.5],["un",146.58,146.68],["procès",146.74,147.34]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Lui qui m’aimait sans condition,","t":148.2,"e":150.4,"w":[["Lui",148.2,148.32],["qui",148.36,148.48],["m’aimait",148.54,148.94],["sans",149.02,149.28],["condition",149.36,150.4]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"S’est fatigué de mes soupçons.","t":150.76,"e":153.16,"w":[["S’est",150.76,150.9],["fatigué",150.98,151.58],["de",151.64,151.86],["mes",151.96,152.18],["soupçons",152.28,153.16]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Et un matin il est parti,","t":153.46,"e":155.5,"w":[["Et",153.46,153.56],["un",153.62,153.7],["matin",153.76,154.2],["il",154.44,154.56],["est",154.62,154.82],["parti",154.9,155.5]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Emportant mon bonheur avec lui.","t":155.68,"e":158.64,"w":[["Emportant",155.68,156.62],["mon",156.7,156.88],["bonheur",156.94,157.68],["avec",157.78,158.18],["lui",158.3,158.64]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Aïe maman, j’ai gâté mon bonheur…","t":159.2,"e":162.32,"w":[["Aïe",159.2,159.54],["maman",159.62,160.12],["j’ai",160.2,160.38],["gâté",160.46,161],["mon",161.1,161.32],["bonheur",161.4,162.32]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Les oreilles ont fermé mon cœur…","t":162.58,"e":164.74,"w":[["Les",162.58,162.84],["oreilles",162.92,163.26],["ont",163.3,163.42],["fermé",163.5,163.94],["mon",164,164.24],["cœur",164.34,164.74]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"J’ai laissé partir ma perle rare,","t":164.8,"e":167.24,"w":[["J’ai",164.8,164.94],["laissé",164.98,165.38],["partir",165.46,165.82],["ma",165.96,166.2],["perle",166.3,166.84],["rare",166.96,167.24]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Aujourd’hui je pleure dans le noir.","t":167.48,"e":170.02,"w":[["Aujourd’hui",167.48,168.14],["je",168.54,168.8],["pleure",168.88,169.1],["dans",169.16,169.32],["le",169.36,169.48],["noir",169.56,170.02]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Mon cœur pleure…","t":171.02,"e":172.04,"w":[["Mon",171.02,171.14],["cœur",171.2,171.56],["pleure",171.66,172.04]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Mon âme pleure…","t":172.32,"e":173.36,"w":[["Mon",172.32,172.54],["âme",172.62,172.9],["pleure",172.98,173.36]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Mon bonheur est parti ailleurs…","t":173.64,"e":176.04,"w":[["Mon",173.64,173.76],["bonheur",173.82,174.42],["est",174.46,174.58],["parti",174.64,175.14],["ailleurs",175.2,176.04]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Aujourd’hui je comprends la leçon…","t":188.68,"e":191.32,"w":[["Aujourd’hui",188.68,189.3],["je",189.38,189.54],["comprends",189.62,190.22],["la",190.28,190.4],["leçon",190.48,191.32]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Quand tu trouves quelqu’un qui t’aime,","t":191.9,"e":194.1,"w":[["Quand",191.9,192.1],["tu",192.16,192.28],["trouves",192.34,192.64],["quelqu’un",192.7,193.28],["qui",193.34,193.54],["t’aime",193.66,194.1]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Protège-le…","t":194.18,"e":195.28,"w":[["Protège-le",194.18,195.28]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Quand tu trouves quelqu’un qui te respecte,","t":197.1,"e":200.02,"w":[["Quand",197.1,197.32],["tu",197.36,197.5],["trouves",197.54,197.86],["quelqu’un",197.92,198.5],["qui",198.56,198.72],["te",198.88,199.14],["respecte",199.24,200.02]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Préserve-le…","t":200.18,"e":201.66,"w":[["Préserve-le",200.18,201.66]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Car une perle rare perdue,","t":202.3,"e":204.56,"w":[["Car",202.3,202.54],["une",202.58,202.74],["perle",202.82,203.44],["rare",203.52,203.84],["perdue",203.94,204.56]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Ne revient pas toujours…","t":204.96,"e":207.08,"w":[["Ne",204.96,205.08],["revient",205.14,205.88],["pas",205.96,206.16],["toujours",206.24,207.08]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Marco on the Beat…","t":210.62,"e":214.68,"w":[["Marco",210.62,211.12],["on",212.24,212.44],["the",213.36,213.56],["Beat",214.48,214.68]],"ok":0.25},{"text":"Oh oh oh…","t":215.6,"e":218.04,"w":[["Oh",215.6,215.8],["oh",216.72,216.92],["oh",217.84,218.04]],"ok":0.0},{"text":"Les oreilles m’ont trompée…","t":218.96,"e":220.4,"w":[["Les",218.96,219.12],["oreilles",219.18,219.56],["m’ont",219.6,219.74],["trompée",219.82,220.4]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Et mon cœur paie le prix…","t":222.08,"e":225.1,"w":[["Et",222.08,222.16],["mon",222.22,222.42],["cœur",222.52,223.54],["paie",223.72,224.14],["le",224.24,224.4],["prix",224.58,225.1]],"ok":1.0}]}